Added the ``plate_format`` setting to write Plate content for Plone Aurora sites that have not upgraded yet: ``plate_format="somersault"`` in ``html_to_blocks()``, ``markdown_to_blocks()``, ``volto_blocks()`` and ``slate_to_plate()``, ``--plate-format somersault`` in the ``convert`` and ``slate2plate`` commands, a ``plate_format`` field on ``POST /html``, ``POST /markdown`` and ``POST /volto``, and a ``plate_format`` query parameter on ``POST /slate2plate``. ``main`` is the default, and the ``somersault`` format is deprecated. @ericof
